1
00:00:20,291 --> 00:00:22,589
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:38,113 --> 00:00:43,530
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:46,913
=Episode 5=

4
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:50,213
(15 Minutes Ago)

5
00:00:52,679 --> 00:00:53,960
(Why are you in such a hurry?)

6
00:00:55,359 --> 00:00:57,815
(Don't touch me. I'm ticklish.)

7
00:00:58,640 --> 00:00:59,640
(I'll do it myself.)

8
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:06,920
So, what are you planning to do next?

9
00:01:08,439 --> 00:01:09,640
Zhang Haotian

10
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,480
isn't someone who has the guts
to make a move.

11
00:01:12,159 --> 00:01:12,560
So,

12
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,920
he relies on emotions
to manipulate people.

13
00:01:15,519 --> 00:01:16,719
The less someone has of something,

14
00:01:16,879 --> 00:01:18,359
the more they want to possess it.

15
00:01:18,439 --> 00:01:21,359
I want to stir up that desire in him.

16
00:01:22,079 --> 00:01:23,959
I think I can do it.

17
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:25,760
You have a plan?

18
00:01:26,079 --> 00:01:28,000
I'm going to do something
even more exciting.

19
00:01:30,570 --> 00:01:35,035
(Now)

20
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:47,040
(I'll make you)

21
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:49,079
(remember me forever.)

22
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,319
(Jiang Lai was afraid of heights.)

23
00:02:01,439 --> 00:02:03,615
(Where did she get the courage to jump?)

24
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:11,000
How did you do that move?

25
00:02:11,688 --> 00:02:12,608
(Happy New Year)
Sorry, Director.

26
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:13,879
I'll do another take after I rest.

27
00:02:13,953 --> 00:02:15,833
Take a break! Another one later!

28
00:02:16,073 --> 00:02:16,759
Thank you, Director.

29
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:17,719
Thank you, Director.

30
00:02:20,919 --> 00:02:22,439
What are you doing here?

31
00:02:24,919 --> 00:02:26,280
It's all thanks to you.

32
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,240
You framed me

33
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,120
and made me lose my job.

34
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:30,560
I'm warning you.

35
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,039
Stay away from me.

36
00:02:37,096 --> 00:02:38,177
(Zhang Haotian.)

37
00:02:38,550 --> 00:02:41,041
(This slap marks Zhao Ke's
declaration of war.)

38
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,560
(The Jiang Lai you knew, controlled,)

39
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,439
(and hurt is already dead.)

40
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,360
(From now on,)

41
00:02:51,199 --> 00:02:52,080
(I control this game.)

42
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:58,039
(She actually dared to hit me.)

43
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,639
(Interesting.)

44
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:06,800
Hey.

45
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,599
Haotian.

46
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,960
I still don't think this is wise.

47
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,319
Your priority right now

48
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:11,280
is keeping Lin Lulu under control.

49
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,800
I'll keep an eye on Jiang Lai.

50
00:03:13,344 --> 00:03:17,719
I've clawed my way through all
these years for money and power.

51
00:03:18,199 --> 00:03:20,319
I've never dared to gamble
with my own life.

52
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:21,879
What are you talking about?

53
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:23,680
What's wrong with you?

54
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,199
Nothing.

55
00:03:25,479 --> 00:03:26,960
I just suddenly realized

56
00:03:28,319 --> 00:03:29,879
there's a strange beauty in madness.

57
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:38,759
Weird.

58
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:46,919
Cheers.

59
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,080
You guys have fun. I'm leaving.

60
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,879
Hey, you.

61
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,759
Let's talk.

62
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,520
Talking to me isn't cheap.

63
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:06,479
Do I look like I can't afford it?

64
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,280
No.

65
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:09,280
But you're not my type.

66
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:14,520
Then what is your type?

67
00:04:14,759 --> 00:04:15,520
I like...

68
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,439
Then am I...

69
00:04:19,199 --> 00:04:20,800
your type?

70
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:27,000
You are my type.

71
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:30,959
You are a woman.

72
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:32,519
Why are you butting in?

73
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,079
So?

74
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,120
Come to my place and talk?

75
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:42,000
Sure.

76
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:55,519
You're in the way.

77
00:04:56,199 --> 00:04:58,160
Do you go with just anyone?

78
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:00,199
That's a nasty thing to say.

79
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,399
None of your business.

80
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:05,560
You said talking to you
comes at a price, right?

81
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,560
What? Got money to burn?

82
00:05:15,879 --> 00:05:16,680
Enter any amount you want.

83
00:05:16,705 --> 00:05:17,459
(Transfer Amount)

84
00:05:17,879 --> 00:05:18,759
Fine, I will.

85
00:05:34,448 --> 00:05:36,149
(Transfer Amount: -¥100,000.00)

86
00:05:44,759 --> 00:05:46,160
Sorry, my queen.

87
00:05:46,279 --> 00:05:47,959
But he offered too much.

88
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:51,560
So, sir, where do you want to talk?

89
00:06:01,275 --> 00:06:07,366
(Endless Love; Combat Online Crimes)

90
00:06:23,519 --> 00:06:24,839
We're talking in the car?

91
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,000
Mr. Zhang?

92
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,439
After you had Lin Lulu kick me out,

93
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,800
you started following me everywhere.

94
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,560
So tell me,

95
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,720
what do you want?

96
00:06:42,639 --> 00:06:43,879
I already paid you.

97
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,600
What else do you think I want?

98
00:06:49,439 --> 00:06:50,439
Now,

99
00:06:51,199 --> 00:06:53,120
you're not afraid of Ms. Lin
finding out?

100
00:06:55,758 --> 00:06:58,558
(I want to see just how far you'll go.)

101
00:06:59,439 --> 00:07:00,720
Enough with the nonsense.

102
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:36,279
(Jiang Lai, stay focused.)

103
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:38,000
(You are Zhao Ke now.)

104
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,920
(You absolutely can't blow your cover.)

105
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:40,759
(Absolutely.)

106
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:42,079
(Don't let him get anything on you.)

107
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:46,000
Miss Zhao?

108
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:53,560
I think I forgot to mention something.

109
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,480
The money you gave me

110
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,959
is only enough for an appetizer.

111
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:14,839
(Haotian.)

112
00:08:15,279 --> 00:08:16,399
(Zhao Ke really exists.)

113
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:21,240
(But if I back out now, everything
I've done will be for nothing.)

114
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:24,879
What about her appearance?

115
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:30,079
(Jiang Lai, how are you going
to make him believe you're Zhao Ke?)

116
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:32,519
(That's exactly how she looks.)

117
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:33,919
(She looks just like Jiang Lai.)

118
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,399
Miss Zhao.

119
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:46,720
Could you finish what
you start next time?

120
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,720
Leaving me hanging like this

121
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,480
is really frustrating.

122
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,360
(I'll find out who you really are.)

123
00:09:20,639 --> 00:09:21,320
(Honey.)

124
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,080
(I want to have a baby with you.)

125
00:09:24,919 --> 00:09:26,000
(A handsome baby.)

126
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,039
Honey?

127
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:42,879
What's wrong?

128
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,519
Nothing.

129
00:09:56,421 --> 00:09:58,421
(Trapped)

130
00:09:58,679 --> 00:10:02,965
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

131
00:10:04,037 --> 00:10:06,849
♪I should forget you♪

132
00:10:07,318 --> 00:10:12,395
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

133
00:10:12,419 --> 00:10:14,259
♪To carry on♪

134
00:10:14,515 --> 00:10:19,372
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

135
00:10:19,738 --> 00:10:21,626
♪You no longer have the strength♪

136
00:10:23,925 --> 00:10:26,806
♪You want me to go there for you♪

137
00:10:28,374 --> 00:10:34,180
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

138
00:10:34,406 --> 00:10:37,545
♪Your freedom♪

139
00:10:38,245 --> 00:10:42,676
♪Has become my cage♪

140
00:10:43,604 --> 00:10:49,395
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

141
00:10:50,746 --> 00:10:56,596
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

142
00:10:57,059 --> 00:11:03,006
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

143
00:11:03,286 --> 00:11:06,536
♪You told me♪

144
00:11:06,933 --> 00:11:11,439
♪I would shine like a star♪

145
00:11:12,283 --> 00:11:15,616
♪But you forgot♪

146
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:20,480
♪To teach me how to live without you♪

147
00:11:20,699 --> 00:11:26,524
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

148
00:11:28,045 --> 00:11:31,829
♪So hazy and blurred♪
